=== ana: step 40000 of 53880 (74.239% of its plan) ===
## User

The factorial of a natural number.

## Type

type
```agda
fact : ℕ → ℕ
```

## Term

```agda
fact zero = 1
fact (suc n) = n * fact n
```

## agda

-- We can prove that fact is a natural number.

fact-is-not-even : (n : ℕ) → fact n ＝ 2 * n
fact-is-not-even zero = refl
fact-is-not-even (suc n) = fact-is-not-even n ∙ ap suc (fact-is-not-even n)
```

## agda

-- We can prove that fact is a natural number.

fact-is-not-even' : (n : ℕ) → fact n ＝ 2 * n
fact-is-not-even' n = fact-is-not-even n ∙ fact
